    "detailed_description": "Santa Sling is a first-person VR where you play as Santa delivering presents to kids from your sleigh in a Christmas-themed town. <br><br>Use your magic slingshot to target chimneys before Christmas Eve ends! Earn bonus points by launching the presents through the rings. <br><br>Features <br>- Fully Christmas themed, highly polished town and music<br>- Three different scenarios to deliver happiness to<br>- Precision scoring: hit the rings for bonus points! <br>- A vast range of toys that you can interact with<br>- Christmas music, tons of visual special effects, and much more! <br><br>Note: HTC Vive Headset and Controllers required to play the game<br><br> Available for Arcades on SpringboardVR ",
